sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Customer as Customer01
    participant PBP as PostBillPay
    participant SPDB as SP dB
    participant Paynow as Paynow iFrame
    participant FZ as FZ Processing

    Note over Customer,PBP: Billpay Code = 8881
    Note over SPDB: Payment Merchant ID = ZZZ
    Note over SPDB,FZ: Card Storage Merchant ID = VPB

    Customer->>PBP: Choose Billpay code (8881)

    PBP->>SPDB: Determine Payment Merchant ID from Billpay code
    SPDB-->>PBP: Payment Merchant ID = ZZZ

    Customer->>PBP: Choose payment method: New credit/debit card

    PBP->>Paynow: Initialise iFrame
    Note right of Paynow: Alias + Token + Storage Merchant ID VPB

    Paynow-->>Customer: Render Paynow iFrame

    Customer->>Paynow: Enter card details
    Customer->>PBP: Select Save details and continue

    Paynow->>FZ: Store card against Merchant ID VPB
    FZ-->>Paynow: Alias + token

    Paynow-->>PBP: Return alias + token

    PBP->>SPDB: Store alias, token, Billpay Code 8881, and Payment Merchant ID ZZZ
    SPDB-->>PBP: Stored card available for Billpay Code 8881

    PBP->>FZ: Process payment using token against Merchant ID ZZZ
    FZ-->>PBP: Payment result

    PBP-->>Customer: Payment complete
